{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110412","id":3406141909,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6oA8vN","number":110412,"title":"Expose some `EditorInspector` customization","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-11T11:37:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T11:04:12Z","closed_at":"2026-04-08T11:03:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110412","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110412.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110412.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot-proposals#12755.\r\n\r\nThis exposes a somewhat arbitrary set of methods from `EditorInspector`, to allow for easily creating your own `EditorInspector` from scripts, that looks and feels like the `EditorInspector` found in `InspectorDock`.\r\n\r\nThe list of exposed methods is as follows:\r\n\r\n- `set_autoclear`\r\n- `set_show_categories`\r\n- `set_use_doc_hints`\r\n- `set_hide_script`\r\n- `set_hide_metadata`\r\n- `set_use_filter`\r\n- `register_text_enter` (as `set_filter`)\r\n- `set_use_folding`\r\n- `collapse_all_folding`\r\n- `expand_all_folding`\r\n- `expand_revertable`\r\n\r\nNote that this is mostly (with the exception of `register_text_enter`) exposing stuff as they're named/designed in C++. There might very well be some argument for renaming/refactoring some of this stuff before exposing them, such as:\r\n\r\n1. Maybe exposing `set_autoclear` as `set_auto_revert`.\r\n2. Maybe splitting up `set_show_categories` into `set_show_standard_categories` and `set_show_custom_categories`.\r\n3. Maybe exposing `set_use_doc_hints` as `set_use_doc_tooltips`.\r\n4. Maybe exposing `set_hide_script` as `set_show_script_controls`.\r\n5. Maybe exposing `set_hide_metadata` as `set_show_metadata_controls`.\r\n6. Maybe adding getters as well and exposing the applicable ones as actual properties.\r\n\r\nAlso note that to achieve better parity with the `EditorInspector` found in `InspectorDock`, we would ideally expose `set_property_name_style` and `set_use_settings_name_style` as well, but I wasn't sure how to best expose `EditorPropertyNameProcessor::Style` without also needing to expose `EditorPropertyNameProcessor`, which seemed undesirable.","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110412/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}